      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors report a new case of left bundle branch block with pain during exercise, with arteriographically normal coronary arteries. Clinical findings and the course of the condition are reviewed. Pathophysiological mechanisms are discussed, with attribution of first place to an ischemic theory."},
